{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38273","headline":"寒食日重游李氏园亭有怀 · 韩偓","name":"寒食日重游李氏园亭有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往年同在鸾桥上，见倚朱阑咏柳緜。\n今日独来香径里，更无人迹有苔钱。\n伤心阔别三千里，屈指思量四五年。\n料得他乡遇佳节，亦应怀抱暗凄然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}